    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2276" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amnĭcus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to a river</i> (only
			post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calami,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 36, 66, § 166</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insula Metubarris amnicarum maxima,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of those formed by rivers</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					25, 28, § 148</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calami,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 36, 66, § 166</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pisces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Mos. 205</span></i>
			.</div>
